```bash
node server/server.js
```

- Environment:
```env
PORT=3000
MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://username:password@cluster.mongodb.net/saleh_furniture
```

## Notes
- This app uses WhatsApp links for direct customer communication.
- For production, replace demo PIN auth with real secure authentication.
