# Saleh Furniture

A modern luxury furniture showroom and admin dashboard for Saleh Furniture, built with React + Vite frontend and Express + MongoDB backend.

## Features
- Premium showroom / catalog
- Custom configurator with live pricing
- Checkout form
- WhatsApp order integration
- Admin login with PIN
- Product management
- Inventory dashboard
- MongoDB persistence

## Tech Stack
- React + Vite
- Express
- MongoDB + Mongoose
- Tailwind CSS

