# Saleh Furniture

A modern luxury furniture showroom and admin dashboard built with React + Vite frontend and Express + MongoDB backend.

## Features
- Premium furniture catalog
- Custom configurator with live price calculation
- Customer checkout form
- WhatsApp order integration
- Admin login with PIN
- Inventory management
- Order dashboard
- MongoDB persistence

