# Saleh Furniture

A modern luxury furniture showroom and admin dashboard built with React + Vite frontend and Express + MongoDB backend.

## Features
- Premium furniture catalog
- Custom configurator with live price calculation
- Customer checkout form
- WhatsApp order integration
- Admin login with PIN
- Inventory management
- Order dashboard
- MongoDB persistence

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: React + Vite
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Backend: Node.js + Express
- Database: MongoDB + Mongoose

## Installation
1. Install dependencies:
```bash
npm install
```

2. Set up MongoDB in `server/.env`:
```env
PORT=3000
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/saleh_furniture
```

3. Run backend:
```bash
npm run server
```

4. Run frontend:
```bash
npm run dev
```

5. Open:
```text
http://localhost:5173
```

## Admin Login
- Admin PIN: 1234
- Staff PIN: 0000

## Build
```bash
npm run build
```

## Production Deployment
### Frontend (Vercel)
Set environment variable:
```env
VITE_API_URL=https://your-render-service.onrender.com
```

### Backend (Render)
Set environment variables:
```env
PORT=3000
MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://username:password@cluster.mongodb.net/saleh_furniture
```

Start command:
```bash
node server/server.js
```
